1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:04,900
Did you know the Leaning Tower of Pisa was once closed because it might fall?

2
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:08,250
The tower started to lean while it was still being built.

3
00:00:08,250 --> 00:00:12,050
The ground is soft clay, so one side slowly sank.

4
00:00:12,050 --> 00:00:16,150
In 1990, it leaned too much, so they closed it.

5
00:00:16,150 --> 00:00:20,150
Engineers took out tiny bits of soil from under the other side.

6
00:00:20,150 --> 00:00:23,450
Then the tower slowly moved back by itself.

7
00:00:23,450 --> 00:00:26,850
In 11 years, they straightened it by about 45 cm.

8
00:00:26,850 --> 00:00:31,100
It still leans, but it should be fine for hundreds of years.
